Hi Bogdan,

I would recommend that you use the KRONOS workflow to generate the allelic counts.  Please see the announcement post (https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/titancna/OeoiTJrQZjo).

extractAlleleReadCounts is deprecated and will be removed in the next version.

Hope this helps.

Best,
Gavin

